  "description": "Dependency-injection wiring for the DotNetCore.Lutter resilience kernel. Registers named pipelines into the kernel's own registry and hands that registry to the IServiceProvider, so a composition is built once and resolved as one instance; a named pipeline can also be bound to an IConfiguration section and reloaded when that section changes. References the Microsoft.Extensions injection, configuration and options abstractions - never Microsoft.Extensions.Resilience.",
